Walking into a restaurant in Japan with no reservation? Say this 🍻
Count your group, then say 'no reservation'.

Today's phrases:
• ふたり (futari) = Two people
• よやく (yoyaku) = Reservation
• こちらへ どうぞ (kochira e douzo) = This way, please

